## Check the implementation

Test clicking every error link, submitting with a keyboard, returning to the summary and correcting only one of several errors. Do not create repeated live announcements.

Use the [civica accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS error summary](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/error-summary) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica markup, Arial typography and civica assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

